WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.066
Imagine your team gets AI colleagues who actually get work done – securely, on your own server.

00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:09.680
This is AI Employee.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:16.018
Every agent has a clear role, such as marketing, research or personal assistant.

00:00:16.018 --> 00:00:20.070
With its own computer, its own tools and its own memory.

00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:25.573
You give the task in plain language, just like you would to a colleague.

00:00:25.573 --> 00:00:30.285
The agent researches, writes – and delivers the result right in the chat.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.824
Not quite right yet? Just follow up.

00:00:34.985 --> 00:00:36.709
And you stay in control:

00:00:36.709 --> 00:00:44.105
for every capability, you decide whether the agent may use it, only with your approval – or not at all.

00:00:44.864 --> 00:00:51.184
How independently it works, you set in four levels – from read only to fully autonomous.

00:00:52.016 --> 00:00:55.536
Anything sensitive waits for your decision in Approvals.

00:00:57.601 --> 00:01:02.455
Plan recurring work once – the agent handles the rest on schedule.

00:01:02.455 --> 00:01:04.881
And every result stays traceable.

00:01:06.012 --> 00:01:10.667
The dashboard shows what your team delivers – and what it costs.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:13.212
Budgets cap spending automatically.

00:01:14.512 --> 00:01:19.178
AI Employee. Your AI team – on your own infrastructure.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:24.352
In the browser and as an iPhone app. Request your demo today.
